+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14320.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix bug with :func:`mne.preprocessing.interpolate_bridged_electrodes` where ``inst.info["bads"]`` was cleared and not restored when too many electrodes were bridged together and a :class:`RuntimeError` was raised, by `Carina Forster`_.
\ No newline at end of file
